    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a4/Raval_QBULB_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241130025708\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Raval QBULB \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a4/Raval_QBULB_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20241130025708\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1069\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Raval QBULB .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Raval_QBULB_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>恶魔头盔士兵</b>\n</p><p>一位美丽的女战士，其祖先是被称为恶魔的魔法生物。尽管外表娇小，但她战斗技艺精湛，用蛮力挥舞巨大的金属法杖。她与其他美丽战士战斗，唯一目的是比较彼此的力量。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c9/Raval_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241130025348\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Raval Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c9/Raval_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20241130025348\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1020\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Raval Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Raval_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820023815\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n1